{"page":362,"width":1671,"height":2491,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"422","words":[{"text":"422","x":166,"y":136,"width":57,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 9 에인 메모리","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":293,"y":139,"width":114,"height":26},{"text":"9","x":420,"y":138,"width":20,"height":22},{"text":"에인","x":469,"y":139,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"메모리","x":518,"y":140,"width":61,"height":23}]},{"text":"같은 이동 장치 컴퓨터는 ARM 처리기를 A卜岳한다. 홍미로운 점은 lntel은 집의 설계","words":[{"text":"같은","x":297,"y":259,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"이동","x":371,"y":258,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"장치","x":445,"y":258,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"컴퓨터는","x":519,"y":258,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"ARM","x":647,"y":261,"width":79,"height":28},{"text":"처리기를","x":744,"y":259,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"A卜岳한다.","x":874,"y":257,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"홍미로운","x":1016,"y":256,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"점은","x":1158,"y":255,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"lntel은","x":1234,"y":254,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"집의","x":1362,"y":254,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"설계","x":1443,"y":254,"width":58,"height":36}]},{"text":"와 제조를 모두 담당하지만, ARM은 오직 설계1i11 한니는 점이다. ARM은 구조 설계를","words":[{"text":"와","x":294,"y":316,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"제조를","x":339,"y":315,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"모두","x":440,"y":317,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"담당하지만,","x":511,"y":313,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"ARM은","x":676,"y":316,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"오직","x":799,"y":315,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"설계1i11","x":872,"y":314,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"한니는","x":971,"y":313,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"점이다.","x":1079,"y":311,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"ARM은","x":1192,"y":311,"width":123,"height":33},{"text":"구조","x":1329,"y":312,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"설계를","x":1410,"y":310,"width":94,"height":35}]},{"text":"이용하여 칩을 만들 수 있는 혀기를 집 제-조회시에 준다. Apple은 iPhone과 iPad 이","words":[{"text":"이용하여","x":295,"y":371,"width":117,"height":35},{"text"