text":"임베디드","x":1378,"y":481,"width":126,"height":36}]},{"text":"시스템을 위한 아키텍처 디자인을 제공한다. ARM 아키텍처에서 실행되는 장치들이 매","words":[{"text":"시스템을","x":293,"y":542,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"위한","x":426,"y":542,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"아키텍처","x":496,"y":541,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"디자인을","x":624,"y":540,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"제공한다.","x":752,"y":541,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"ARM","x":890,"y":545,"width":82,"height":27},{"text":"아키텍처에서","x":986,"y":540,"width":183,"height":36},{"text":"실행되는","x":1187,"y":539,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"장치들이","x":1331,"y":539,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"매","x":1474,"y":542,"width":27,"height":34}]},{"text":"우 많으므로 1,(Ⅷ억 개가 넘는 ARM 프로세서가 생산되어 생산된 집의 양으로 따지면","words":[{"text":"우","x":291,"y":600,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"많으므로","x":333,"y":599,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"1,(Ⅷ억","x":466,"y":599,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"개가","x":583,"y":598,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"넘는","x":652,"y":598,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"ARM","x":720,"y":601,"width":79,"height":28},{"text":"프로세서가","x":812,"y":599,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"생산되어","x":975,"y":599,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"생산된","x":1111,"y":598,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"집의","x":1221,"y":597,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"양으로","x":1299,"y":598,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"따지면","x":1409,"y":597,"width":93,"height":36}]},{"text":"가장 널리 A卜\u0026되는 아키텍처가 되었다. 이 절에서는 64 비트 ARMv8 아기텍처에 관해","words":[{"text":"가장","x":292,"y":657,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"널리","x":364,"y":656,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"A卜\u0026되는","x":436,"y":657,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"아키텍처가","x":563,"y":656,"width":147,"height":34},{"text":"되었다.","x":721,"y":656,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":829,"y":656,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"절에서는","x":871,"y":657,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"64","x":1001,"y":660,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"비트","x":1050,"y":656,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"ARMv8","x":